ody":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n~~Previously, when enabling `fit_content_*`, the scrollbar calculation would consider `max_size`, but the `get_minimum_size` calculation did not.~~\r\n~~Added `max_size` calculation to `get_minimum_size`.~~\r\n\r\nSee https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120351#pullrequestreview-4510565532\r\nThe actual issue is that `BoxContainer::_resort()` in `BoxContainer` uses `get_combined_minimum_size` instead of `get_bound_minimum_size` when calculating the layout. The PR has been updated.\r\n\r\nBefore:  \r\n<img width=\"301\" height=\"332\" alt=\"屏幕截图_20260616_233458\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f6ba41fd-be7a-414a-a018-edce7386edca\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n<img width=\"301\" height=\"268\" alt=\"屏幕截图_20260616_233257\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1d9b25a0-b947-4a64-bb5b-a7368826218d\" />\r\n\r\ntest:\r\n[textedit_test_2026-06-16_23-33-09.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29009227/textedit_test_2026-06-16_23-33-09.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https:/